<Base title="Methodology">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold">How the Huddle Grade works</h1>
  <p class="mt-4">
    Every component is a league-wide weekly percentile within its position pool, blended with
    published weights and shrunk toward 50 for small samples. The full table renders from the
    grading engine's own specification once milestone 1 lands.
  </p>
</Base>
